+# Inspection: current member message detail surface
+
+Task 001 inspected the current member message route, controller rendering, auth gates,
+and test coverage before converting the page to LiveView.
+
+## Route and auth pipeline
+
+- `web/lib/memba_web/router.ex`
+  - `GET /messages/:message_id` is currently routed inside `scope "/", MembaWeb`.
+  - It uses `pipe_through [:browser, :club_member_required]`.
+  - The route target is `MembaWeb.PageController.show_message/2`.
+- `:browser` assigns current identity data via `MembaWeb.UserAuth.fetch_current_identity/2`.
+- `:club_member_required` calls `MembaWeb.UserAuth.require_active_club_member/2`.
+  - It reads `club_id` from the query string.
+  - Unauthenticated visitors are redirected to `/auth` and the full return path,
+    including query string, is stored in the session.
+  - Signed-in identities without active membership for `club_id` receive
+    `403 Forbidden`.
+
+## Controller loading and authorization
+
+- `web/lib/memba_web/controllers/page_controller.ex`
+  - `show_message/2` only matches when both `"club_id"` and `"message_id"` are
+    present.
+  - It casts `club_id` with `Ecto.UUID.cast/1`; invalid `club_id` returns
+    `403 Forbidden`.
+  - It finds the selected active club from `conn.assigns.current_identity_clubs`.
+    A missing selected club returns `403 Forbidden`.
+  - It loads the message with `Memba.Messaging.get_message/1`.
+  - Missing messages or messages whose `message.club_id` differs from the
+    selected `club_id` render the existing `404` page.
+  - Successful requests assign:
+    - `:page_title`
+    - `:selected_club`
+    - `:message`
+    - `:sender_name`
+    - `:member_receipts`
+    - `:member_receipt_count`
+    - `:member_receipt_groups`
+  - Receipt rows are loaded with `Messaging.list_member_receipts/1` and mapped
+    through `MembaWeb.MemberReceiptPresentation.present_receipt/1`.
+  - Current grouping order is `opened`, `delivered`, `sent`,
+    `delivery problem`; empty groups are rejected.
+
+## Current template and stable selectors
+
+- `web/lib/memba_web/controllers/page_html/message.html.heex`
+  - Uses `<Layouts.club_site>` with selected club name and current identity.
+  - Root element:
+    - `#member-message-detail`
+    - `data-club-id`
+    - `data-message-id`
+  - Navigation:
+    - `#back-to-club-home-link`
+    - `href="/?club_id=..."`
+  - Receipt summary:
+    - `#member-receipts-summary`
+    - `data-receipt-count`
+  - Receipt groups:
+    - `data-testid="member-receipt-group"`
+    - `data-receipt-status`
+    - group count at `data-testid="receipt-group-count"`
+  - Receipt rows:
+    - `data-testid="member-receipt"`
+    - `data-recipient-id`
+    - `data-recipient-name`
+    - `data-receipt-status`
+  - Status elements:
+    - `data-testid="receipt-status"`
+    - `data-receipt-status`
+    - icon element with `data-testid="receipt-status-icon"` and
+      `data-icon-name`.
+  - The member template does not render delivery IDs, provider addresses,
+    provider channel names, provider reasons, or admin links.
+
+## Receipt presentation helper
+
+- `web/lib/memba_web/member_receipt_presentation.ex`
+  - Maps internal status values to member labels and Heroicons:
+    - `sent` → `Sending`, `hero-clock`
+    - `delivered` → `Delivered`, `hero-check-circle`
+    - `delivery problem` → `Delivery problem`, `hero-exclamation-triangle`
+    - `opened` → `Opened`, `hero-envelope-open`
+  - Blank or missing statuses fall back to `sent`.
+  - Unknown statuses are humanized with `hero-question-mark-circle`.
+
+## Existing automated coverage
+
+- `web/test/memba_web/router_test.exs`
+  - Asserts `GET /messages/:message_id` currently routes through
+    `[:browser, :club_member_required]` to `PageController.show_message/2`.
+- `web/test/memba_web/controllers/page_controller_test.exs`
+  - Covers active member access to `GET /messages/:message_id?club_id=...`.
+  - Covers unauthenticated redirect to `/auth` with preserved return path.
+  - Covers signed-in users outside the requested club receiving `403 Forbidden`.
+  - Covers message/club mismatch rendering `404`.
+  - Asserts the stable message, receipt group, receipt row, and status icon
+    selectors listed above.
+  - Asserts member pages do not expose operator-only fields.
+- `web/test/memba_web/controllers/member_message_detail_test.exs`
+  - Adds coverage for inactive members receiving `403 Forbidden`.
+  - Adds coverage for selected-club/message ownership mismatch returning `404`.
+  - Covers all four member-facing receipt statuses and icons.
+  - Reasserts operator-only details stay off the member page.
+- `web/test/memba_web/member_receipt_presentation_test.exs`
+  - Covers the status presentation helper.
+- `web/test/memba_web/live/browser_acceptance_harness_test.exs`
+  - Covers stable receipt selectors through feature-style browser helpers.
+- `acceptance-tests/features/member_message_deliverability.feature`
+  - Existing feature text covers member-visible receipt statuses and remains
+    locked for this iteration.
+- `acceptance-tests/features/support/member_message.js`
+  - Current support locates member rows by `data-testid="member-receipt"` and
+    `data-recipient-name`.
+  - Later collapse-by-default work will need this support to expand the relevant
+    visible receipt group before asserting row content.
+
+## LiveView conversion notes for later tasks
+
+- The member route must preserve the public URL shape:
+  `GET /messages/:message_id?club_id=<club_id>`.
+- The LiveView route should remain in the existing member scope or an equivalent
+  `live_session` that preserves the `:browser` and active-club-member gate.
+- Controller-era failure behaviours to preserve:
+  - unauthenticated GET redirects to `/auth` and stores the full return path;
+  - non-members/inactive members receive `403 Forbidden`;
+  - invalid or unauthorized `club_id` receives `403 Forbidden`;
+  - missing messages or selected-club/message mismatches render `404`.
+- Existing stable row attributes must be preserved after rows become
+  expand/collapse controlled.
